# Check everything out with LF, on every platform.
#
# The generators in tools/ and the Apps Script files write LF. Without this a
# Windows checkout converts them to CRLF, and then regenerating the importer
# reports a diff on every line of an 88KB file that has not actually changed —
# which hides real changes and makes "a clean checkout reproduces this" untestable.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pptx binary
*.docx binary
